WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.190
Mutanena! Yau tarihi ne!

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.750
Na zama Baba — a hukumance!

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.750
Felix, don Allah — ni na ɗauki cikin wata
shida.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.250
Zaɓen da na ci! Gagarumar nasara!

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.900
Mama, muna da labari… Ada tana da ciki!
Wata shida!

6
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.240
Wata shida? Sai yau kuke gaya min?

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Mama, mun so mu tabbata komai lafiya
tukuna…

8
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.790
Tabbatar da me?

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.310
Cewa na Felix ne?

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.930
Mama! Ah-ah!

11
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.330
Matar da ta zo yanzu, ta auri ɗana tilo —
yanzu ciki ya bayyana.

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.490
A wannan Lagos, dole mutum ya tambaya.

13
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.910
Mama, ina girmama ki.

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.430
Wannan jaririn jikanki ne.

15
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.450
Za mu gani. DNA za ta faɗa.

16
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.500
Masoyiya, ba haka take nufi ba… Mama 'yar
barkwanci ce.

17
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.120
Felix, kai kaɗai ne ɗan barkwanci a gidan
nan.

18
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.810
Meow… Zuciyar Mama na zargi.

19
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.610
Babu wanda zai zagi ɗana.

20
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.430
Babu kowa. Na rantse.

21
00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.770
Felix, ɗauki kayana. Daga yau, nan zan
zauna.

22
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.550
Ubangiji ya aiko ta… don ta sa ido.

23
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.600
Haka matsalar ta fara.
